    talismans-south-park-ontology-explainer:text "A rebuild of Jessica Talisman’s South Park Ontology Explainer for Intentional Arrangement, made from a rulebook. The model, wording and layout follow her page. South Park is the work of Trey Parker and Matt Stone; the portraits are Fandom images." .

